ITEM 9 693
ITEM 0 412 ADJ1=1225
ITEM 1 1774 ADJ1=1225
*DESCRIPTION_START ITEM EXAM 1
The Windrunner is a sturdy, two-masted sailing ship, her sails currently furled and lashed. A crew of seasoned sailors moves about the deck coiling rope and checking rigging, while a grizzled, weathered man in a long coat watches the horizon from the quarterdeck.
*DESCRIPTION_END
IFENTRY
	ECHO PLAYER Captain Aldous Kestrel calls out from the deck of the Windrunner, "Bound for the Inner Sea docks! All aboard who's paying passage!"
ENDIF
IFVERB GO 0
	IFVAR INTNUM8 ! 1
		ECHO PLAYER Captain Kestrel blocks the top of the gangplank. "Hold on there, friend. Passage back to the mainland is two silver, paid up front."
		ECHO OTHERS %N tries to board the Windrunner without paying the captain.
	ENDIF
	IFVAR INTNUM8 = 1
		ECHO PLAYER You climb the gangplank and step aboard the Windrunner.
		ECHO OTHERS %N climbs the gangplank and steps aboard the Windrunner.
		MOVE 7101
		AFFECT 7101
		ECHO OTHERS %N crosses the gangplank from the dock and boards the Windrunner.
		AFFECT 1804
	ENDIF
	CLEARVERB
ENDIF
IFVERB PAY -1
	IFVAR INTNUM8 = 1
		ECHO PLAYER Captain Kestrel tips his hat. "Already settled up, friend. No need to pay twice."
		ECHO OTHERS %N tries to pay the captain again.
	ENDIF
	IFVAR INTNUM8 ! 1
		IFVAR WEALTH < 20
			ECHO PLAYER Captain Kestrel eyes your thin purse and shakes his head. "Come back when you've got the fare, friend."
			ECHO OTHERS %N can't seem to scrape together the fare.
		ENDIF
		IFVAR WEALTH = 20
			SUB WEALTH 20
			ECHO PLAYER You hand over your last coin to Captain Kestrel.
			ECHO OTHERS %N hands the captain some coins.
			EQUAL INTNUM8 1
		ENDIF
		IFVAR WEALTH > 20
			SUB WEALTH 20
			ECHO PLAYER You pay the captain his fare. He nods and marks your name in the ship's ledger.
			ECHO OTHERS %N hands the captain some coins.
			EQUAL INTNUM8 1
		ENDIF
	ENDIF
	CLEARVERB
ENDIF
;
